# nondesu — Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Host-based rules are enforced by functions/_middleware.ts because Pages
# _redirects has no Host matching (domain-level redirects are unsupported).
#
# admin.nondesu.com
#   /                    → /admin/  302
#   /admin               → /admin/  302
#   /profile, /portfolio, … → https://nondesu.com/:path  302
#   /api/*, /admin/*, /assets/* → pass through
#
# nondesu.com
#   /admin, /admin/*     → https://admin.nondesu.com/admin/…  302
